recommend keep-going the Braid arc reads across a checkpoint now (r1 decided · r2 travels · r3 across a Knot). Next: r4 closes the arc — a real reproducible on-disk fixture carrying a reverting or committing chain read true (app == awk over the same bytes a keeper can walk), mirroring pledge_true/purse_true. REMEMBER is well past stale — a remember/align pass folding the whole Mycelium arc (Cord through Braid) onto the card is worth its own round. A served braid · per-account mint authority · breach renames (cairn-first) · deep debride · seed force-push stay Keaton's hand.
